// Content > Media library (CMS.6, /admin/content/media): a grid of assets with thumbnail, name and size; upload (desktop file
// picker), alt text, copy URL, delete, folders. The same page is the picker other pages open: `pick` sends the asset up.
// State is ContentMediaState.
import { Tokens } from "@rimelight_design/tokens.slint";
import { Type } from "@rimelight_ui/typography.slint";
import { Button, ButtonVariant } from "@rimelight_ui/components/button.slint";
import { ScrollArea } from "@rimelight_ui/components/scroll-area.slint";
import { PageLoadState } from "@rimelight_ui/components/page-state.slint";
import { Input } from "@rimelight_ui/components/input.slint";
import { MediaCellItem } from "types.slint";

export global ContentMediaState {
    in-out property <PageLoadState> state: PageLoadState.loading;
    in-out property <string> error;
    in-out property <string> notice;
    in-out property <string> folder;
    in-out property <[string]> folders;
    in-out property <[MediaCellItem]> cells;

    callback reload();
    callback open-folder(string);
    callback upload();
    callback alt(string, string);
    callback delete(string);
    callback copy(string);
    callback pick(string);
}

// One cell: the thumbnail (images only), the name, the size, and the alt text with its save.
component MediaCell inherits Rectangle {
    in property <MediaCellItem> cell;
    callback copy();
    callback delete();
    callback pick();
    callback alt(string);

    width: 200px;
    background: Tokens.surface-raised;
    border-radius: Tokens.radius-r6;
    VerticalLayout {
        padding: Tokens.space-2;
        spacing: Tokens.space-1;
        Rectangle {
            height: 120px;
            background: Tokens.surface-sunken;
            // UNSURE: thumbnails need the picture decoder (space_page_kit page_data::decode_picture) fed from Rust; until then an
            // image shows its name here.
            Text { text: root.cell.image ? "Image" : "File"; color: Tokens.text-muted; horizontal-alignment: center; vertical-alignment: center; }
            TouchArea { clicked => { root.pick(); } }
        }
        Text { text: root.cell.name; color: Tokens.text-primary; overflow: elide; }
        Text { text: root.cell.size; color: Tokens.text-muted; font-size: Type.caption.size; }
        alt-input := Input { text: root.cell.alt; placeholder: "Alt text"; accessible-name: "Alt text"; }
        HorizontalLayout {
            spacing: Tokens.space-1;
            Button { text: "Save alt"; variant: ButtonVariant.ghost; clicked => { root.alt(alt-input.text); } }
            Button { text: "Copy URL"; variant: ButtonVariant.ghost; clicked => { root.copy(); } }
            Button { text: "Delete"; variant: ButtonVariant.danger; clicked => { root.delete(); } }
        }
    }
}

export component ContentMediaPage inherits Rectangle {
    background: Tokens.surface-base;
    in property <string> route;
    callback opened(string);
    init => { root.opened(root.route); }
    changed route => { root.opened(root.route); }

    VerticalLayout {
        padding: Tokens.space-4;
        spacing: Tokens.space-3;

        HorizontalLayout {
            spacing: Tokens.space-3;
            Text { text: "Media"; font-size: Type.heading.size; color: Tokens.text-primary; horizontal-stretch: 1; vertical-alignment: center; }
            Button { text: "Upload"; variant: ButtonVariant.primary; clicked => { ContentMediaState.upload(); } }
        }
        HorizontalLayout {
            spacing: Tokens.space-2;
            Button { text: "All folders"; variant: ContentMediaState.folder == "" ? ButtonVariant.primary : ButtonVariant.ghost; clicked => { ContentMediaState.open-folder(""); } }
            for f in ContentMediaState.folders: Button {
                text: f;
                variant: ContentMediaState.folder == f ? ButtonVariant.primary : ButtonVariant.ghost;
                clicked => { ContentMediaState.open-folder(f); }
            }
        }
        if ContentMediaState.notice != "": Text { text: ContentMediaState.notice; color: Tokens.text-muted; }
        if ContentMediaState.error != "": Text { text: ContentMediaState.error; color: Tokens.text-muted; }

        ScrollArea {
            vertical-stretch: 1;
            // Cells wrap in rows of the available width; a plain flow of the same cells keeps the layout simple.
            VerticalLayout {
                spacing: Tokens.space-2;
                for cell in ContentMediaState.cells: MediaCell {
                    cell: cell;
                    copy => { ContentMediaState.copy(cell.id); }
                    delete => { ContentMediaState.delete(cell.id); }
                    pick => { ContentMediaState.pick(cell.id); }
                    alt(text) => { ContentMediaState.alt(cell.id, text); }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
